@startuml
title BrewLite — Railway production deployment (PROPOSED)
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45

node "Client device" as client {
  artifact "Web browser" as browser
}

cloud "GitHub" {
  artifact "BrewLite repository\nRelease commit SHA" as repo
  node "GitHub Actions runner" as ci {
    artifact "Quality gate\nInstall / Lint / Typecheck\nTests / Build" as gate
  }
}

cloud "Railway project / production environment" as railway {
  node "Railway HTTPS Edge" as edge

  node "Web service" as web {
    artifact "Next.js UI + BFF\napps/web/Dockerfile" as next
  }

  node "API service" as api {
    artifact "NestJS application\napps/api/Dockerfile\nMock payment inside API" as nest
  }

  node "Database service" as db {
    database "PostgreSQL 17" as pg
  }

  node "Persistent Railway Volume" as volume {
    artifact "PostgreSQL data directory" as data
  }

  node "API pre-deploy execution\nTemporary execution, not a fourth service" as migration {
    artifact "prisma migrate deploy\nFrom approved API image" as migrate
  }
}

browser --> edge : HTTPS / Railway domain
edge --> next : HTTP / configured target port
next --> nest : Private HTTP / API internal hostname
nest --> pg : Private PostgreSQL / 5432
pg -- data : Persistent storage

repo --> gate : PR + release SHA checks
gate ..> web : Deploy only after gate PASS\nand release approval
gate ..> api : Same approved SHA
migrate --> pg : Private connection / migration

note bottom of railway
PROPOSED — not deployed or verified on Railway.
Only Web has a public domain.
API and PostgreSQL have no public endpoint/TCP proxy.
Secrets remain in Railway variables / CI secrets.
Compose is local only.
end note

note bottom of ci
B/E must verify gate failure blocks deployment.
No successful Railway pipeline is claimed.
end note
@enduml